.TH elfshaker-esi-create 1  "elfshaker 1.0.0-rc1" "elfshaker Manual"
.SH NAME
elfshaker\-esi\-create \- Creates an empty ESI index
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBelfshaker esi create\fR [OPTIONS] <ESI_FILE>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates an empty ESI index
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-meta\fR \fI<VERSION>\fR
Wire\-format version to write.
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
v1
.IP \(bu 2
v2
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-url\fR \fI<URL>\fR
Public URL recorded in the index.
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Replace an existing ESI file.
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-backup\fR
Do not replace <ESI_FILE>.bak with the previous contents.
.TP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR
Show informational progress and diagnostic messages.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIESI_FILE\fR>
ESI file to create.
